# install.ps1

## Requirements

- `#Requires -Version 5.1`, `$ErrorActionPreference = "Stop"`
- Idempotent; no admin; user-level `uv tool install`
- Check `$LASTEXITCODE` after every `uv` / `sentinel-ai` call

## Install source

```powershell
# Default — NOT PyPI
uv tool install --force "git+https://github.com/mhdrezky/sentinel-ai.git"

# Local dev override
uv tool install --force --from $resolvedPath sentinel-ai
```

## Remote piping (`irm | iex`)

Parameters do not pass through pipe. Support:

```powershell
$env:SENTINEL_REPO_PATH = "D:\path\to\project"
irm …/install.ps1 | iex
```

## PATH

After uv install, refresh `%USERPROFILE%\.local\bin` (and `.cargo\bin` if needed) in the **current** process before verifying `sentinel-ai`.

## Host config

Single source of truth: fetch `src/sentinel_ai/sentinel.toml` from GitHub raw URL, or inline fallback matching that file exactly (include `enable_thinking = false`). Never overwrite existing host config.
